WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.480
Events are already in motion...

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.950
We can no longer go back.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.440
At this rate, ARC-V will be revived!

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.340
Let me go!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.980
Right now, he's bound.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.420
But how long will it hold?

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.910
I must revive Ray before he is free!

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.020
Yuzu, Ruri, Rin, Serena...

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:44.820
By sending you four into ARC-V, 
the world will be reunited,

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.900
and Ray will be revived.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.250
And those cards, too...

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.230
Hurry!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.830
Input more life energy!

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:56.940
Yes, sir.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.770
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:06.030
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.350
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.980
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:51.020
The Light in Everlasting Darkness

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.800
Wake up, Layra!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:12.540
Open your eyes, Layra!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.510
Let's go, Layra.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.340
We have to stop the dimensional fusion.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:23.420
I'm the only one who can stop 
the resurrection of Z-ARC...

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.280
Layra...

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.020
The world is going to be destroyed.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.960
What are you talking about?

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.710
Wake up, Layra!

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.590
It isn't that, Brother.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.310
That's what Ray is saying.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.830
I can hear her!

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.220
Ray?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.580
What are you saying?

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.490
We don't have time to talk about that now.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.040
Let's go!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.000
Don't go!

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.470
Ray is saying...

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.210
That this is necessary to defeat Z-ARC!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.830
Revive me before Z-ARC is resurrected.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:04:00.760
If you do not, Z-ARC really will 
destroy the world this time.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:02.890
That's what Ray is saying!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.580
Impossible.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.890
Ray has taken host in Layra?

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.440
To protect himself,

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.660
Layra obtained the ability 
to empathize with others.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.200
What are you saying?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.910
If the dimensions are united,

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:20.230
the four current dimensions could be destroyed.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.070
Brother...

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.730
Don't you want Ray to come back?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.780
Unlike me,

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.880
she's your real sibling!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.820
Then let me ask you, don't you want 
to save Serena and the others?

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.740
Are you saying that the reality we've lived,

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.890
that all the people have survived, 
deserves to disappear?

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.660
You have lots of people on your side, Brother.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.760
But Ray...

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.090
Ray only has me!

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.180
So I won't let you go.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:03.380
If you insist on going,

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.850
I'll fight you!

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.820
Layra is challenging me to a duel?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.580
The Layra I know?

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.860
Very well...

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.080
I accept!

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.780
Field Spell Crossover.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.320
Duel!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.180
I will go first.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.730
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:35.880
Scale 2 D/D Brownie and Scale 6 
D/D Savant Thomas!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:46.060
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 3 and 5 simultaneously.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.980
Pendulum Summon.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.820
Appear, my monsters!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.770
D/D Lilith

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.750
and D/D Nighthowl!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:03.190
And I activate my Continuous Spell Dark 
Contract with Summoning Surplus.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:09.520
Once per turn, I can send fusion-component 
monsters to the graveyard,

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:13.390
to summon a D/D/D Fusion Monster.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:18.120
I send D/D Lilith and D/D 
Nighthowl to the graveyard.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:20.970
The enchantress who wanders the dark night,

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.530
be guided by the roar that 
cuts through the night,

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.600
and give birth to the new king.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.200
Fusion Summon!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:31.380
Be born, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:37.140
And I activate D/D Brownie's Pendulum Effect!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:41.390
When a monster is Special Summoned from
 my Extra Deck to my side of the field,

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.930
I can Special Summon this monster!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.990
Then, I activate Flame King 
Genghis's monster effect!

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:53.220
When a D/D monster, other than this one, 
is Special Summoned to my field,

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:57.640
I can Special Summon a D/D 
monster from my graveyard.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:01.180
I Special Summon D/D Lilith!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.100
I activate D/D Lilith's monster effect!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:11.110
Once per turn, I can add one D/D monster 
from my graveyard to my hand.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:17.690
Then, Level 3 D/D Brownie 
tunes Level 4 D/D Lilith!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.190
The roar that cuts through the darkness,

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:25.030
gain the speed of a gale and 
give rise to a new king!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.730
Synchro Summon!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:34.300
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.500
I also Normal Summon D/D 
Nighthowl from my hand!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:47.190
Its effect lets me Special Summon 
D/D Lilith from my graveyard.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:51.080
But a monster Special Summoned with this effect

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.120
has 0 attack and defense points.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:57.470
In addition, the effect of Continuous Spell 
Dark Contract with Summoning Surplus

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:01.110
reduces D/D Lilith's level by 1, once every turn,

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.760
until my End Phase.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:09.100
And so, I overlay Level 3 D/D Lilith 
and D/D Nighthowl!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.810
Impregnable, invincible king,

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:17.480
travel through eternity and descend...

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.440
Xyz Summon!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:24.840
Be born, Rank 3 D/D/D Stone King Darius!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:28.890
I activate the effect of Stone King Darius.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.560
I use one Overlay Unit to destroy Dark 
Contract with Summoning Surplus,

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:38.320
and add a new Dark Contract card to my hand.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:41.610
Then, I set one card and end my turn!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.900
Rapid Special Summons from Pendulum...

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.190
Fusion, Synchro, Xyz.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:54.090
But I have this card that I got from my brother.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:09:00.450
I wonder what kind of duel you, who were 
raised outside the light, could show us.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.340
You cannot see anything.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.720
So take that light from your opponent.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.400
You said it before, Brother...

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.370
"Duelists emit light."

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.310
You are a shining duelist,

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:23.840
but the more that light shines, 
the stronger I become, too.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.180
So I won't lose.

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.940
My turn!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.980
Then, what if I make it so 
you can't steal that light?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:37.120
I now activate my Continuous Trap Dark 
Contract with the Eternal Darkness!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.820
Those who lack this contract

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:44.300
cannot activate spells and 
traps that target monsters.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:49.400
They also cannot Fusion, Synchro, Xyz,

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.270
or Tribute Summon, using monsters on the field.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.420
I can't see Brother's monsters anymore...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.820
My strategy is sealed.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.210
You are now helpless.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:08.920
It was I who taught you how to duel.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.630
Now, you have no chance of beating me.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.960
Give up and surren—

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:20.060
I summon Film Magician from my hand!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.810
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.510
What?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:34.040
Despite everything, he will still fight me?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.050
Layra...

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.550
I feel it.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.120
Those two are so close...

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:50.090
I have to get close to Hugo and Joeri...

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.140
Reiji, hurry!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.740
My turn!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:01.370
Dark Contract with the Eternal Darkness's 
effect deals 1000 damage to me.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:02.770
Battle.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:07.370
Stone King Darius attacks Film Magician!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.950
I activate Film Magician's effect!

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:15.320
When this monster is attacked, its attack 
and defense points become

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:19.920
equal to the attacking monster's 
during damage calculation!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:23.920
And Film Magician cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.500
Only Darius is destroyed!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.860
I knew all that, of course.

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:31.840
When Stone King Darius is destroyed by battle,

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:36.040
I can use one Overlay Unit to negate its destruction.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:42.480
I also destroy the monster it fought 
and deal you 500 points of damage.

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:50.420
Then, Gust King Alexander attacks you directly!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.450
Layra...

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:04.500
I gave light to you, the one 
raised in hellish darkness.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:08.350
Your heart, shrouded in darkness,

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:11.880
absorbed light, like a sponge absorbs water.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.780
And you soon became a duelist without peer...

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.880
But you are still nothing but a vessel.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.920
You cannot surpass me.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:23.020
Let it be finished!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.920
Flame King Genghis attacks you directly!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.630
Action Spell Damage Banish!

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:37.600
Just once, it can reduce battle damage to 0.

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:42.090
I picked it up during Alexander's attack.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.710
This is how we...

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.680
How the Lancers fight!

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.790
I end my turn.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.880
ARC-V's activation energy has reached 60%.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.620
Sending in Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.300
Transmission to ARC-V complete.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:05.940
Ray...

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.700
The fact that I made it this far 
is thanks to you, my brother.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.960
But from now on...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.610
Almost there.

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.410
Hold out, Layra!

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:19.140
My turn!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.270
It's here!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.650
My brother gave me light.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:27.350
But from now on...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.350
I activate my Continuous Trap Photo Frame!

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:35.280
I choose one spell or trap card 
on your side of the field,

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.300
and it gains this card's name and effect.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:42.500
I choose Continuous Trap Dark Contract 
with the Eternal Darkness!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.000
What?

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.540
Layra had the contract, too?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.980
And I activate my spell card Pure Ray!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.440
When both of our fields contain 
cards with the same name,

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.210
I can destroy one of each.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.530
And for each card destroyed, the attack points

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.580
of all monsters on the field go down by 100!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.570
Just now, what was that?

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:20.000
I summon C/C Critical Eye!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:26.480
Then I activate Continuous Spell 
Montage Fusion from my hand!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:32.150
Using this card, I film Gust King Alexander 
on your side of the field.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:37.790
I fuse Gust King Alexander and Critical Eye!

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:43.130
Noble king of gales, reside in my eye 
and offer me your power!

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.930
Fusion Summon!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:49.820
Appear, supersonic halberd that 
smashes everything,

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.250
Level 8 C/C/C Sonic Halberd of Battle!

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:57.540
What is that monster?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.750
Layra had a monster I didn't know about?

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:05.220
During the Battle Phase, 
Sonic Halberd can attack twice.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:10.060
Right now, I'm not the one giving Layra light!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:14.240
And if a Wind Attribute Monster 
is on your side of the field,

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.430
it can attack once more!

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:21.130
You... You're trying to surpass me?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.060
Battle!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:27.710
C/C/C Sonic Halberd of Battle attacks 
D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.960
An awakening of self...

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.760
Layra, who was once a vessel,

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:41.820
has gained a sense of self and 
arrived at a new level of dueling.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:45.420
Then I attack D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:54.040
In that instant, Flame King Genghis's 
effect lets me return

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:57.270
Dark Contract with the Eternal Darkness 
to my hand from my graveyard!

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:01.240
Where did I misjudge him?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:05.440
Last, I attack D/D/D Stone King Darius!

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:13.100
Have I created a monster named "Layra"?

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:25.760
When Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon on my 
field is destroyed and sent to the graveyard,

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:30.860
I can banish one of its fusion components

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:35.940
to Special Summon Greedy Venom 
Fusion Dragon from my graveyard.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.150
And I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:48.140
In that instant, Crystal Wing 
Synchro Dragon's effect ends,

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:50.120
and its attack points return to normal.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:52.540
Well, it's your turn now.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:53.860
Go on, bring it.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.860
Get ready...

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.830
My turn!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.830
Hugo,

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:02.330
while you remain yourself, Z-ARC will not revive.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.840
Please endure!

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:06.510
Battle!

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:11.910
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon attacks 
Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.880
You expect your attack points to increase 
due to your monster's effect?

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:18.010
Yeah.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.520
When it does battle with a 
monster, Level 5 or above,

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.450
it adds the attack points of its opponent.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:29.890
But have you forgotten what happens 
when you destroy my Greedy Venom?

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.230
Don't mock me!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.040
It destroys all monsters on the field,

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:39.210
and deals the destroyed monster's original 
attack points as damage to its controller!

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:47.750
And when Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon 
is destroyed and sent to the graveyard,

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:51.720
you can banish one of its components

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:56.380
to Special Summon Greedy Venom 
Fusion Dragon from the graveyard.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.090
Right!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.190
I know all of that, but...

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:07.230
Edo and Kaito taught me that winning 
a victory without pain is impossible!

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:12.300
I activate my trap card Extra Shave Reborn!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:17.200
When a monster Special Summoned 
from my Extra Deck is destroyed,

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.300
I can Special Summon one monster

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:23.810
from my graveyard, of a lower level, 
that's been summoned from my Extra Deck!

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:30.650
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:34.600
And when a monster is Special 
Summoned to my side of the field,

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:38.600
I can Special Summon Speedroid 
Rubberband Plane.

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:47.340
I use its effect to decrease Greedy Venom 
Fusion Dragon's attack points by 600!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:53.780
Then I activate Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:57.360
When a monster, Level 5 or above, 
on the field activates its effect,

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.990
I negate that effect and destroy the monster!

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:04.960
And what was the point of that?

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:09.430
After that, until the end of my turn, 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's attack points

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:13.400
increase by those of the destroyed monster!

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:17.740
That's 1000 points higher than those 
of Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.280
And you have exactly 1000 life points.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.600
It's over now!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.480
Battle!

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:29.450
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon attacks 
Greedy Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:33.440
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:38.390
I activate the monster effect of Drosophyllum
 Hydra in my graveyard.

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:39.490
What?

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.060
When combat damage is dealt,

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:46.460
I can swap one Predaplant in my graveyard
 with one banished monster,

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:49.170
halving battle damage!

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:59.880
Then, like you, I activate my 
trap card Extra Shave Reborn.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.080
What?

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.580
He has the same trap?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:08.040
I Special Summon Starving Venom 
Fusion Dragon from my graveyard!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:12.970
I end my turn.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.920
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect ends,

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:18.400
and its attack points return to normal.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.700
My turn...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.370
Draw!

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:25.840
I activate Starving Venom Fusion Dragon's effect.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:29.870
Once per turn, until the End Phase, 
I can negate the effect

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.040
of one monster on the field, Level 5 
or above, and steal that effect.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.780
M-My Clear Wing's effect?

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:40.670
Of course, if you wanted, you could 
use Clear Wing's effect

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.100
to destroy Starving Venom now.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:47.150
But if you do, Starving Venom's effect 
will activate from the graveyard

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.760
and destroy Clear Wing,

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:54.040
dealing its attack points as damage 
to you and leading to your loss.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:58.010
Too bad for you!

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:01.110
I activate Equip Spell Predapruning.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:07.190
I Special Summon one Predaplant in my 
graveyard and equip this card to it.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.780
I activate Predaplant Drosophyllum 
Hydra's monster effect.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:17.490
Once per turn, I can banish one 
Predaplant in my graveyard

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:22.460
and reduce Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon's attack points by 500.

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:27.560
Since I have no choice, I shall have to 
use Clear Wing's effect in your place.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:32.940
When a monster, of Level 5 or above, 
activates its monster effect,

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:36.580
I negate that monster's effect and destroy it.

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:45.800
Then, the destroyed monster's attack points

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:49.120
are added to its own until the turn's end.

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:54.840
You get to be destroyed by the 
effect of the dragon you loved.

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.190
Satisfying, isn't it?

00:21:57.900 --> 00:21:58.860
Battle!

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:04.650
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon attacks 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.230
I won't let you have my son!

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:54.410
D-Dad...

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:56.430
Dad?

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:58.720
You're father and son?

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:02.160
You have turned many of my students into cards.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:05.660
I must avenge them.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.360
Sure, I'll fight you,

00:24:08.360 --> 00:24:11.090
you caring father.

00:24:11.820 --> 00:24:16.120
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Greatest Entertainer of the Age.

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.230
The fun is only getting started!
